  akta:'The audited Akta/GetAktaList response is a body.message list, rendered as typed nullable lowerCamel akta records with complete nested sertipikatAkta and wilayah arrays. Cards show deed type/number, raw source dates and role as bound by native, the first certificate and a local expand/collapse control for all remaining certificates. Local lowercase search matches only nomor, tipe, jenisPihak, tglAkta or tglLapor without trimming; the A/E information legend and expansion do not request a detail API. A readyToRatingPPAT-dependent placeholder is informational only; no PPAT rating action is implemented. Native rating navigation is proved only to a separate screen, with questionnaire/read/write/autoprompt behavior unaudited. Unknown models keep the generic fallback. Whole-region first-uppercase/rest-lowercase is proved for the ASCII path; full Unicode equivalence, complete bootstrap effects and current production nonempty acceptance remain unproved. Null-safe search and region handling are deliberate browser differences. A separate 46-check Wakaf/Aktaku suite verifies actual functions and handlers, including 105 nested certificates and 105 regions, with no network calls.',
